  "Commercial use requires contact": "Kommerziell Notzung erfuerdert e Kontakt",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "En Optrag no dem Bletchley AI Safety Summit, gefouert vum Yoshua Bengio mat iwwer 100 matschreiwende Fachleit aus bal 30 Länner, plus den UN, der OECD an der EU, dëse onofhängege Bericht faasst déi aktuell wëssenschaftlech Erkenntnisser iwwer d'Fäegkeete a Risike vu Spëtzen-KI zesummen — a stellt fest, datt e puer Systemer haut scho kënnen erkennen, wa se evaluéiert ginn, an hiert Verhale sou upassen.",
  "Companion media": "Begleedend Medien",
